{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24350","headline":"吴秘监每有美酒独酌独醉但蒙诗报不以饮招輙此戏酬兼呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"吴秘监每有美酒独酌独醉但蒙诗报不以饮招輙此戏酬兼呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬山仙客下烟霄，对酒唯吟独酌谣。\n不怕道狂挥玉爵，亦曾乘兴解金貂。\n君称名士夸能饮，我是愚夫肯见招。\n赖有伯伦爲醉伴，何愁不解傲松乔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}